rry & Kamsties operationalization mismatch: the paper tests agent-vs-intent deviation, not inter-reader disagreement.\n---\n\n**Your task:** In 300-400 words, respond to R2's review:\n1. Which of R2's points do you agree with and why?\n2. Which do you disagree with or think are overstated?\n3. Does R2's review change your scores? If so, how?\n4. What is the most important unresolved issue between your reviews?"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TcYtz7RYNnCem9Qyo7Wigv","session_id":"ed42e909-7586-4fce-8151-53367c735e4f","uuid":"faed06fc-151c-4eaf-8548-7509ba84ec02","timestamp":"2026-05-20T12:09:18.892Z"}
